      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The SFR-SFC presents guidelines dedicated to cardiac and coronary imaging using CT in the area of indications, technological requirement including both hardware and software, patient conditioning, CT protocols and related results concerning radiation dose, image quality and diagnostic value. These guidelines are based either on up-dated medical literature proofs and/or on expert consensus."},
